<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/868/868792.png" type="image/x-icon">
    <title>404 not found</title>
    <style>
    body {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f0ff 0%, #f9fafc 100%);
        font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    }
    .error-404-card {
        border-radius: 1.5rem;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.13);
        border: none;
        background: #fff;
        padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 2rem 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 3.5rem;
        animation: fadeInDown 0.7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
    }
    @keyframes fadeInDown {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-30px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .error-404-img {
        max-width: 320px;
        width: 100%;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(13,71,161,0.10));
    }
    .error-404-title {
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #1976d2;
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    }
    .error-404-text {
        color: #374151;
        font-size: 1.13rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    }
    .btn-home {
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1976d2 0%, #42a5f5 100%);
        color: #fff;
        font-weight: 700;
        border-radius: 2rem;
        padding: 0.7rem 2.2rem;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(25, 118, 210, 0.13);
        border: none;
        transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-home:hover {
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1565c0 0%, #1976d2 100%);
        color: #fff;
        transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.04);
        text-decoration: none;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <center>

    
    <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 col-md-10 col-lg-7 mx-auto text-center">
            <div class="error-404-card text-center">
                <img src="https://ouch-prod-var-cdn.icons8.com/qa/illustrations/previews/AA8pBC0VxYAjrUBU.webp" class="error-404-img" alt="Página no encontrada">
                <h1 class="error-404-title">Ups... no se ha encontrado la página</h1>
                <p class="error-404-text">Verifica la dirección o vuelve al inicio para continuar navegando.</p>
                
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-home">
                    <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2749/2749678.png" width="30px" class="img-fluid" alt="home">
                     Volver al home
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</center>
</body>
</html>


